ription><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/she-loves-the-baby-more-than-me-trump-on-wh-ex-press-secretary-leavitt-as-he-searches-for-successor/articleshow/136068217.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/she-loves-the-baby-more-than-me-trump-on-wh-ex-press-secretary-leavitt-as-he-searches-for-successor/articleshow/136068217.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T11:23:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136068333,imgsize-72670.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Woman seeks half of £6m mansion after living with millionaire for 45 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135885509.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-woman-who-lived-with-an-88-year-old-millionaire-for-45-years-is-claiming-half-of-his-6-million-mansion-alleging-he-promised-her-ownership-despite-never-marrying-her/articleshow/135885509.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-woman-who-lived-with-an-88-year-old-millionaire-for-45-years-is-claiming-half-of-his-6-million-mansion-alleging-he-promised-her-ownership-despite-never-marrying-her/articleshow/135885509.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T11:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135886512,imgsize-170337.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Massachusetts father ordered to pay $55,868 after wasting his children’s fund]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135992067.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A father in Massachusetts faced devastating consequences after losing his children's college fund due to poor investment choices in high-risk assets. Following a contempt complaint from his ex-wife, the court ruled against him, mandating a payment of around $55,868 for his children's education, divided equally between them. Although he argued he couldn't afford this, the court found his claims unconvincing.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-massachusetts-father-invested-his-childrens-56600-college-fund-in-cryptocurrency-cannabis-and-volatile-stocks-an-appeals-court-upheld-an-order-requiring-him-to-pay-55868/articleshow/135992067.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-massachusetts-father-invested-his-childrens-56600-college-fund-in-cryptocurrency-cannabis-and-volatile-stocks-an-appeals-court-upheld-an-order-requiring-him-to-pay-55868/articleshow/135992067.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T11:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135992393,imgsize-1197876.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Water on fire’: British swimmer flags cost of war after 15km Hormuz swim]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136066707.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/water-was-on-fire-british-swimmer-flags-environmental-cost-of-war-after-15-km-strait-of-hormuz-swim/articleshow/136066707.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/water-was-on-fire-british-swimmer-flags-environmental-cost-of-war-after-15-km-strait-of-hormuz-swim/articleshow/136066707.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T10:05:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:c