bout Asmongold's cleanliness challenges. Even with improvements noted in 2026, his home remains a hot topic among viewers, fueling the ongoing chatter about his infamous house saga.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/asmongolds-infamous-house-controversy-returns-after-gta-6-livestream-with-girlfriend-kaise/articleshow/136062783.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/asmongolds-infamous-house-controversy-returns-after-gta-6-livestream-with-girlfriend-kaise/articleshow/136062783.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T01:43:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136062788,imgsize-1328238.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[IShowSpeed teases huge announcement after completing GTA 6 following 52-hour livestream]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136062557.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[IShowSpeed celebrated a remarkable achievement by completing GTA 6's story mode in just 52 hours, far surpassing his initial plan of a 12-hour stream. His enthusiasm led him to extend the session, and upon finishing, he expressed heartfelt thanks and hinted at exciting future plans. Although a PS5 crash presented some obstacles, his progress was secure, keeping fans on the edge of their seats for his next move.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-teases-huge-announcement-after-completing-gta-6-following-52-hour-livestream/articleshow/136062557.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-teases-huge-announcement-after-completing-gta-6-following-52-hour-livestream/articleshow/136062557.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T01:07:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xm